1
00:01:21,400 --> 00:01:24,260
The He Manor is located
in a prime spot in Rongcheng.

2
00:01:24,680 --> 00:01:25,800
It's isolated from the world,

3
00:01:25,800 --> 00:01:27,800
and ordinary people can hardly enter.

4
00:01:27,800 --> 00:01:28,600
Today

5
00:01:28,600 --> 00:01:30,860
happens to be Master He's 60th birthday,

6
00:01:31,160 --> 00:01:33,020
which is why you temps were hired.

7
00:01:33,160 --> 00:01:34,000
Later on,

8
00:01:34,440 --> 00:01:36,640
every one of you better be on high alert.

9
00:01:38,720 --> 00:01:39,840
Are you crazy?

10
00:01:40,680 --> 00:01:41,520
These clothes were made according to

11
00:01:41,520 --> 00:01:42,560
the sizes you registered.

12
00:01:42,560 --> 00:01:44,220
Did you eat too much for lunch?

13
00:01:46,479 --> 00:01:47,800
Let me tell you,

14
00:01:48,160 --> 00:01:49,280
these clothes

15
00:01:49,280 --> 00:01:50,960
are made of imported Italian fabrics.

16
00:01:50,960 --> 00:01:51,320
Are you okay?

17
00:01:51,320 --> 00:01:53,000
Can you afford to pay for it
if you ruin it?

18
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:54,800
If you were official employees
of the He family

19
00:01:54,800 --> 00:01:56,400
and dared to break the rules,

20
00:01:56,759 --> 00:01:58,120
you'd be dead meat.

21
00:02:16,160 --> 00:02:17,420
Look alive, everyone.

22
00:02:17,840 --> 00:02:20,100
Come to me for your pay after the banquet.

23
00:02:28,560 --> 00:02:29,880
It's been 17 years.

24
00:02:30,480 --> 00:02:31,880
I'm finally home.

25
00:02:33,079 --> 00:02:35,520
I am actually Mr. He's
biological daughter,

26
00:02:35,520 --> 00:02:38,180
He Mei, the heiress
of Rongcheng's richest man.

27
00:02:38,320 --> 00:02:39,079
But now I can only return

28
00:02:39,079 --> 00:02:41,079
as a temporary nanny.

29
00:02:42,520 --> 00:02:44,440
To those who once wronged me,

30
00:02:45,320 --> 00:02:46,800
how have you been?

31
00:02:52,600 --> 00:02:54,240
You are not official employees
of the He family,

32
00:02:54,240 --> 00:02:55,570
so you don't have names.

33
00:02:56,160 --> 00:02:58,200
Next, I will call you
by the numbers on your chests...

34
00:02:58,200 --> 00:02:59,600
Let me assign your tasks.

35
00:02:59,760 --> 00:03:00,960
Numbers one through five,

36
00:03:00,960 --> 00:03:03,000
you're in charge of greeting guests
and assigning tables.

37
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:05,640
Numbers six, seven, and eight,
you'll run food from the kitchen.

38
00:03:05,640 --> 00:03:06,640
No sneaking food.

39
00:03:07,160 --> 00:03:08,880
Numbers nine and ten,
go to the wine cellar.

40
00:03:08,880 --> 00:03:10,000
Once the banquet starts,

41
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:11,000
except for numbers one through five,

42
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:12,760
no one else is allowed in the inner hall.

43
00:03:12,760 --> 00:03:13,960
Is that clear?

44
00:03:13,960 --> 00:03:14,800
Understood.

45
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:33,000
Try and hide.

46
00:03:33,120 --> 00:03:34,440
Keep hiding.

47
00:03:44,680 --> 00:03:45,720
I'll go get another one.

48
00:03:45,720 --> 00:03:46,800
You clean up first.

49
00:04:02,880 --> 00:04:04,040
This check

50
00:04:04,040 --> 00:04:04,920
is your reward.

51
00:04:35,480 --> 00:04:36,400
Let me go.

52
00:04:37,159 --> 00:04:37,960
Let go.

53
00:04:38,800 --> 00:04:39,600
Let go.

54
00:04:42,200 --> 00:04:43,040
Woman,

55
00:04:43,600 --> 00:04:46,000
you've successfully caught my attention.

56
00:04:51,600 --> 00:04:52,520
Young Master,

57
00:04:54,880 --> 00:04:56,920
I've noticed you for a long time too.

58
00:05:22,240 --> 00:05:23,100
How dare you...

59
00:05:23,800 --> 00:05:25,860
I thought you liked it, Young Master.

60
00:05:28,240 --> 00:05:29,640
Interesting.

61
00:05:33,720 --> 00:05:35,520
Please behave yourself, Young Master.

62
00:05:35,520 --> 00:05:37,080
Does a poor person like you

63
00:05:37,159 --> 00:05:39,020
want to marry another poor person

64
00:05:39,520 --> 00:05:41,320
and have a bunch of poor kids,

65
00:05:41,640 --> 00:05:43,000
or just give in to me?

66
00:05:44,320 --> 00:05:46,320
If you have any brains,

67
00:05:47,240 --> 00:05:49,600
you'd make the right choice.

68
00:05:49,800 --> 00:05:50,960
I may be poor,

69
00:05:51,280 --> 00:05:52,480
but I have my dignity.

70
00:05:52,520 --> 00:05:53,240
Let go.

71
00:05:53,560 --> 00:05:55,280
Nobody says no

72
00:05:55,760 --> 00:05:57,280
on He Shi's turf.

73
00:05:59,120 --> 00:05:59,960
Let go of me.

74
00:06:01,120 --> 00:06:02,240
Let go.

75
00:06:03,360 --> 00:06:04,040
Let go.

76
00:06:04,040 --> 00:06:05,160
Mrs. He is awake.

77
00:06:05,640 --> 00:06:07,640
Everyone gather to see Mrs. He.

78
00:06:07,640 --> 00:06:08,560
Let go of me.

79
00:06:09,120 --> 00:06:10,760
Why are we still missing one person?

80
00:06:10,760 --> 00:06:11,820
Where is Number 10?

81
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:12,480
Number 10.

82
00:06:12,480 --> 00:06:13,320
Coming.

83
00:06:14,840 --> 00:06:15,700
What Number 10?

84
00:06:34,680 --> 00:06:36,000
Hello, Mrs. He.

85
00:06:36,640 --> 00:06:38,040
Hello, Mrs. He.

86
00:06:39,840 --> 00:06:40,720
Dismissed.

87
00:06:49,280 --> 00:06:49,880
Mrs. He,

88
00:06:50,480 --> 00:06:51,940
you look beautiful today.

89
00:06:52,240 --> 00:06:52,800
Mrs. He,

90
00:06:52,800 --> 00:06:54,130
time for your foot bath.

91
00:07:15,280 --> 00:07:17,840
Isn't that Zhang Xin,
the He family's head maid?

92
00:07:17,840 --> 00:07:19,800
Why is she acting like Mrs. He?

93
00:07:19,800 --> 00:07:20,560
Yeah.

94
00:07:20,560 --> 00:07:22,880
I can't believe she has the eldest
daughter-in-law washing her feet.

95
00:07:22,880 --> 00:07:23,600
But I've heard

96
00:07:23,600 --> 00:07:25,680
the eldest daughter-in-law doesn't come
from a good background either.

97
00:07:25,680 --> 00:07:27,480
So this is what life
in a wealthy family is like.

98
00:07:27,480 --> 00:07:30,280
How are the preparations for
the Master's birthday banquet going?

99
00:07:30,280 --> 00:07:31,440
Madam He,

100
00:07:31,440 --> 00:07:33,920
everything is proceeding smoothly.

101
00:07:36,680 --> 00:07:37,720
That

102
00:07:37,720 --> 00:07:38,800
That is.

103
00:07:44,040 --> 00:07:44,880
The assembly was called ages ago.

104
00:07:44,880 --> 00:07:46,010
Where have you been,

105
00:07:46,200 --> 00:07:47,640
looking like such a mess?

106
00:07:49,400 --> 00:07:50,320
Madam He,

107
00:07:50,440 --> 00:07:51,159
just now the Eldest Young Master...

108
00:07:51,159 --> 00:07:52,320
Liu Dan!

109
00:07:55,560 --> 00:07:56,400
Yes.

110
00:07:58,000 --> 00:08:00,000
You can't even manage a temp worker.

111
00:08:00,200 --> 00:08:02,240
Nothing can go wrong
at the Master's birthday banquet,

112
00:08:02,240 --> 00:08:03,560
or I'll make you pay.

113
00:08:04,280 --> 00:08:05,160
Yes.

114
00:08:10,080 --> 00:08:11,540
Go change your stockings.

115
00:08:12,200 --> 00:08:13,080
Yes.

116
00:08:34,799 --> 00:08:36,600
All the villains

117
00:08:36,600 --> 00:08:38,480
are gathered here.

118
00:08:39,400 --> 00:08:40,000
Go away.

119
00:08:41,039 --> 00:08:43,200
Mom.

120
00:08:47,200 --> 00:08:48,360
Brother.

121
00:08:48,360 --> 00:08:50,240
Let me out!

122
00:08:50,880 --> 00:08:52,120
Brother.

123
00:08:52,320 --> 00:08:53,840
Brother.

124
00:09:00,800 --> 00:09:03,040
You killed my mother

125
00:09:03,040 --> 00:09:05,120
and sold me deep into the mountains.

126
00:09:06,160 --> 00:09:08,040
Do you know how hard it was for me

127
00:09:08,240 --> 00:09:09,640
to make my way back here

128
00:09:09,640 --> 00:09:11,080
over the past 17 years?

129
00:09:12,800 --> 00:09:14,040
From today on,

130
00:09:14,560 --> 00:09:17,420
I will be every single one
of your worst nightmares.

131
00:09:31,920 --> 00:09:33,850
The banquet starts in ten minutes.

132
00:09:34,200 --> 00:09:35,080
One, two, three, four, five.

133
00:09:35,080 --> 00:09:37,210
I can't find a single one of you inside.

134
00:09:37,280 --> 00:09:38,080
What are you dawdling for?

135
00:09:38,080 --> 00:09:38,800
Hurry up.

136
00:09:39,120 --> 00:09:40,120
Do you want your pay or not?

137
00:09:40,120 --> 00:09:40,960
Yes, yes, yes.

138
00:09:46,080 --> 00:09:47,640
Don't you know your own number?

139
00:09:47,640 --> 00:09:49,320
You are 10, not 01.

140
00:09:49,360 --> 00:09:50,840
The kitchen is out of wine.

141
00:09:50,960 --> 00:09:52,620
Go fetch some from the cellar.

142
00:09:53,360 --> 00:09:54,520
Hurry up.

143
00:09:55,320 --> 00:09:57,160
So clumsy.

144
00:09:57,760 --> 00:09:59,760
I have to get inside the banquet hall

145
00:09:59,760 --> 00:10:00,960
so I can see my dad

146
00:10:00,960 --> 00:10:02,200
and reunite with him.

147
00:10:03,040 --> 00:10:04,000
You idiot.

148
00:10:04,080 --> 00:10:04,920
Honey,

149
00:10:04,920 --> 00:10:05,920
I'm sorry.

150
00:10:06,040 --> 00:10:07,760
I told you to prepare
a birthday gift for Dad,

151
00:10:07,760 --> 00:10:09,480
and you got this junk?

152
00:10:10,080 --> 00:10:11,000
Come here.

153
00:10:11,280 --> 00:10:12,120
Honey.

154
00:10:12,600 --> 00:10:13,520
Honey,

155
00:10:13,520 --> 00:10:14,720
I'm sorry.

156
00:10:16,600 --> 00:10:17,320
Honey.

157
00:10:17,320 --> 00:10:18,280
Get in here.

158
00:10:18,520 --> 00:10:19,600
Please,

159
00:10:19,600 --> 00:10:20,640
don't do this.

160
00:10:23,200 --> 00:10:24,720
Is it that hard to ask you

161
00:10:24,720 --> 00:10:25,560
to do one simple thing?

162
00:10:25,560 --> 00:10:26,280
Honey,

163
00:10:27,160 --> 00:10:28,200
no.

164
00:10:34,240 --> 00:10:35,080
Stop.

165
00:10:38,920 --> 00:10:40,120
Come on, get up.

166
00:10:41,640 --> 00:10:42,720
Why is it you again?

167
00:10:42,760 --> 00:10:43,640
Young Master,

168
00:10:43,920 --> 00:10:45,600
Master He will be back soon.

169
00:10:45,800 --> 00:10:47,930
Butler Liu asked you to go downstairs.

170
00:10:56,200 --> 00:10:56,800
Watch out!

171
00:11:02,080 --> 00:11:02,600
Are you okay?

172
00:11:02,600 --> 00:11:03,960
Do you need to go to the hospital?

173
00:11:03,960 --> 00:11:05,160
I'm fine.

174
00:11:06,800 --> 00:11:09,000
Are you the new temp?

175
00:11:09,320 --> 00:11:10,640
What's your name?

176
00:11:11,160 --> 00:11:12,120
Li Zhangxin.

177
00:11:12,560 --> 00:11:13,800
Could you please

178
00:11:13,920 --> 00:11:16,480
get some ointment from next door?

179
00:11:40,120 --> 00:11:41,680
Mei, this is for you.

180
00:11:44,360 --> 00:11:46,080
Thank you.

181
00:11:50,240 --> 00:11:51,800
Could this be He Yu?

182
00:12:06,640 --> 00:12:07,760
How did he

183
00:12:07,920 --> 00:12:10,120
end up like this?

184
00:12:37,400 --> 00:12:38,480
Thank you.

185
00:12:43,440 --> 00:12:44,840
Is that the second young master, He Yu,

186
00:12:44,840 --> 00:12:46,640
in the next room?

187
00:12:47,120 --> 00:12:48,080
How could he...

188
00:12:48,080 --> 00:12:48,920
Yes,

189
00:12:49,160 --> 00:12:50,560
he's my brother-in-law.

190
00:12:50,720 --> 00:12:52,080
He was in a car accident

191
00:12:52,080 --> 00:12:53,560
three months ago.

192
00:12:53,720 --> 00:12:54,600
But Mr. He

193
00:12:54,600 --> 00:12:56,360
didn't want anyone to know,

194
00:12:56,360 --> 00:12:57,960
so he suppressed the news.

195
00:12:58,000 --> 00:12:58,880
Please,

196
00:12:59,360 --> 00:13:01,000
you must keep this a secret.

197
00:13:01,760 --> 00:13:02,600
Okay.

198
00:13:04,280 --> 00:13:05,880
Why isn't there a caregiver?

199
00:13:06,040 --> 00:13:07,640
I've been taking care of him.

200
00:13:08,800 --> 00:13:10,160
Is there no one else?

201
00:13:12,440 --> 00:13:15,120
Is he really that neglected at home?

202
00:13:16,080 --> 00:13:17,560
Mr. He is here.

203
00:13:47,280 --> 00:13:49,200
I finally get to see
the richest man in Rongcheng.

204
00:13:49,200 --> 00:13:49,880
Is he good-looking?

205
00:13:49,880 --> 00:13:50,720
Yes, he is.

206
00:14:01,440 --> 00:14:02,480
Here, Master.

207
00:14:03,480 --> 00:14:04,480
Master,

208
00:14:10,280 --> 00:14:11,200
Dad,

209
00:14:11,920 --> 00:14:13,000
Master,

210
00:14:13,240 --> 00:14:14,000
Master,

211
00:14:14,080 --> 00:14:14,880
This is

212
00:14:14,880 --> 00:14:16,880
Fu tea from our hometown in Shaanxi.

213
00:14:21,120 --> 00:14:24,720
Thank you all for doing me the honor

214
00:14:25,000 --> 00:14:27,280
of attending my birthday banquet.

215
00:14:27,880 --> 00:14:30,200
I believe you have all heard,

216
00:14:30,480 --> 00:14:32,160
due to my

217
00:14:32,160 --> 00:14:33,360
deteriorating health,

218
00:14:33,360 --> 00:14:34,240
I have decided

219
00:14:34,240 --> 00:14:35,360
today...

220
00:14:35,520 --> 00:14:36,440
To announce

221
00:14:36,520 --> 00:14:39,160
the heir to the He family.

222
00:14:44,120 --> 00:14:44,960
But

223
00:14:45,480 --> 00:14:46,680
unfortunately,

224
00:14:48,800 --> 00:14:51,160
I cannot make this decision for now.

225
00:14:51,800 --> 00:14:52,880
This is because

226
00:14:53,240 --> 00:14:55,560
my biological daughter, He Mei,

227
00:14:56,040 --> 00:14:57,760
is still missing.

228
00:14:58,160 --> 00:14:59,280
Over the years,

229
00:14:59,280 --> 00:15:00,880
I've gone through untold hardships

230
00:15:00,880 --> 00:15:03,320
to find her.

231
00:15:06,400 --> 00:15:07,360
Today,

232
00:15:08,080 --> 00:15:10,410
taking the opportunity of my birthday...

233
00:15:11,280 --> 00:15:13,280
I pray to heaven

234
00:15:14,320 --> 00:15:15,880
that my daughter, He Mei,

235
00:15:16,840 --> 00:15:18,640
will return soon.

236
00:15:18,920 --> 00:15:19,880
Yes, yes.

237
00:15:19,880 --> 00:15:20,760
She'll return

238
00:15:20,760 --> 00:15:22,080
soon.
